        "Content": "Exceptional 6-bedroom detached dormer bungalow on generous site overlooking the the Atlantic Ocean\r\nPanoramic, uninterrupted views of the Atlantic Ocean\r\nPrime location along the popular Wild Atlantic Way\r\nPresented in turnkey condition with spacious, versatile accommodation throughout\r\nZoned, oil-fired central heating with Climote controls, solid fuel stove and open fireplace\r\nPreviously operated as a highly successful Bed & Breakfast, offering excellent tourism potential\r\nHigh-speed fibre broadband available in the area, ideal for remote working\r\nLacken stone features externally add charm and blends seamlessly into surroundings\r\nSheds offering ample storage space\r\nConvenient to Ballycastle, Killala and Ballina, with beaches, golf courses, historic landmarks and coastal attractions all nearby"
